# PRODUCT_DISCOVERY_SPRINT.todo
# Professional Sprint Execution — Product Discovery System
# Created: 2026-03-27
# Risk Gate: VFS Data Integrity Must Be Verified Before Integration
#
# Input State:
#   - Homepage has 8 feature components using hardcoded/skeletal data
#   - VFS manifest exists but has CRITICAL data inconsistency (slotMetadataMap incomplete)
#   - Product queries use legacy categoryPath string matching (not VFS)
#   - VFS accessor functions exist but don't return valid descendant keys
#
# Target State:
#   - All 8 homepage features fetch products via VFS-enabled queries
#   - VFS data integrity validated and fixed
#   - Category pages use VFS unrolled keys for product queries
#   - Filter/sort systems use VFS-aware category resolution

----

## Global Directives

-- Final code output must contain ZERO comments.
-- Every commit must follow taxonomy: A (Forward progress), B (Critical bug fix), C (Refactor), D (Configuration), E (Polish).
-- No VFS integration until data integrity is verified via automated test.
-- All homepage features must use getSelectedProducts with VFS keys, not hardcoded slugs.
-- Test-first approach: each scope contract includes verification before implementation.

