## P2-D1: VFS Data Integrity Audit & Fix

### Scope Contract
CRITICAL: Fix the slotMetadataMap inconsistency where header nodes reference children IDs that don't exist in the map. This breaks subtree queries.

**Files Modified:**
- `scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs` — fix tree reconstruction logic
- `data/catalogue-index.json` — regenerate with complete metadata

**Invariants:**
- Every node in `tree` must have a corresponding entry in `slotMetadataMap`
- All child IDs referenced in metadata must resolve to valid metadata entries

### DoD — Data Integrity Fix

-- [ ] 1.1 — Analyze `build-catalogue-index.mjs`. Identify why intermediate header nodes are excluded from `slotMetadataMap`.
  - Difficulty: 3 - C(scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs): analyze slotMetadataMap population logic

-- [ ] 1.2 — Fix build script: Ensure traverse function populates `slotMetadataMap` for ALL nodes (headers AND links), not just leaf nodes. Headers must have entries with title, url: "#", breadcrumbs, children array, and type: "header".
  - Difficulty: 5 - B(scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs): fix slotMetadataMap to include all header nodes

-- [ ] 1.3 — Run build script: `node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs`. Verify new `catalogue-index.json` has complete slotMetadataMap.
  - Difficulty: 2 - D(scripts): regenerate catalogue-index.json

-- [ ] 1.4 — Create validation script `scripts/verify-vfs-integrity.mjs` that asserts: (a) all tree nodes exist in slotMetadataMap, (b) all children IDs in metadata resolve to existing metadata entries, (c) count consistency (expected 31 nodes based on current data).
  - Difficulty: 4 - A(scripts/verify-vfs-integrity.mjs): create VFS integrity validator

-- [ ] 1.5 — Run validation script. All assertions must PASS before proceeding to P2-D2.
  - Difficulty: 1 - D(scripts): verify VFS integrity

### Verification — P2-D1

-- [ ] V1.1 — Validation script reports: "✓ All 31 nodes present in slotMetadataMap" and "✓ All child references resolve to valid metadata".
  - Difficulty: 1

-- [ ] V1.2 — Manual spot-check: Open `catalogue-index.json`, verify header node "ugyeto8653n495dpf89nzoar" (Headphones) has complete metadata with children array.
  - Difficulty: 1

